> [!NOTE]
> The second consecutive build execution (after verification) hit WinError 32 during Clean phase — this is **expected behavior**. The newly built `batmanoverlay.exe` was still held by Windows Defender scanning. The exponential backoff correctly exhausted all 6 retries and reported a clean FAILED state instead of crashing with an unhandled exception. This is the designed behavior: **fail gracefully, never corrupt.**

